OL,3,APhilippines wins first Eurovision Song
OL,4,AContest Asia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Philippines have won the very first
OL,7,FEurovision Song Contest Asia, hosted in
OL,8,FBangkok and with 11 countries vying for
OL,9,Fthe title.
OL,11,FNineteen-year-old singer Carmelle was
OL,12,Falways a front runner with her women's
OL,13,Fempowerment anthem Sobra-Sobra,
OL,14,Fcomplete with its catchy rap section.
OL,16,FShe earned 211 points in total - 93
OL,17,Ffrom the jury and 118 from the public
OL,18,Fvote - ahead of Thailand's MANG x DAOU
OL,19,Fin second place with 170 points.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
