OL,3,APhilippines wins first Eurovision Song
OL,4,AContest Asia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was a joyous atmosphere at the
OL,7,FOne Bangkok Arena as the crowd cheered
OL,8,Fthe contestants and celebrated the
OL,9,Fpopular winner.
